---
import profilePhoto from '../assets/profile-photo.jpg';
---

<aside class="left-rail">
  <section class="profile-card profile-card-expanded">
    <div class="profile-top">
      <div class="avatar photo-ready">
        <span>S</span>
        <img
          src={profilePhoto.src}
          alt="Seiji profile photo"
          />
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="profile-name">Seiji</div>
        <div class="profile-role">AI & Data / Engineering</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="profile-summary">
      Machine Learning / Data Engineeringを背景に、
      AI・Data・Cloud・Snowflakeを横断して学習と実装を続けています。
    </p>

    <div class="can-do">
      <span class="rail-label">WHAT I CAN DO</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Python / SQLでのデータ処理・自動化</li>
        <li>Machine Learningの分析・モデル実装</li>
        <li>DWH / ETL / データパイプライン設計</li>
        <li>データ移行・検証・Data Quality</li>
        <li>BIダッシュボード / 可視化</li>
        <li>Snowflake / Google Cloudでの実装・設計支援</li>
        <li>グローバル調整・PMO・ドキュメント作成</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="side-card focus-card">
    <span class="rail-label">FOCUS NOW</span>

    <div class="focus-list">
      <div><span class="focus-dot"></span><strong>Snowflake certification</strong></div>
      <div><span class="focus-dot"></span><strong>Data architecture</strong></div>
      <div><span class="focus-dot"></span><strong>AI Engineering</strong></div>
      <div><span class="focus-dot"></span><strong>Global delivery</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="side-card capabilities-card">
    <span class="rail-label">CAPABILITIES</span>

    <div class="cap-group">
      <small>CODE</small>
      <div class="cap-tags">
        <span>Python</span><span>SQL</span><span>JavaScript</span><span>HTML / CSS</span>
        <span>React</span><span>Next.js</span><span>Node.js</span><span>Go</span><span>C++</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-group">
      <small>DATA / AI</small>
      <div class="cap-tags">
        <span>Pandas</span><span>scikit-learn</span><span>XGBoost</span><span>TensorFlow</span>
        <span>Spark</span><span>PySpark</span><span>DWH</span><span>ETL / ELT</span><span>Data Quality</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-group">
      <small>PLATFORMS</small>
      <div class="cap-tags">
        <span>Snowflake</span><span>Google Cloud</span><span>AWS</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-group">
      <small>BI / ANALYTICS</small>
      <div class="cap-tags">
        <span>Tableau</span><span>Power BI</span><span>Looker</span><span>QuickSight</span>
        <span>Excel / VBA</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cap-group">
      <small>ENGINEERING</small>
      <div class="cap-tags">
        <span>Git / GitHub</span><span>Docker</span><span>Linux</span><span>Automation</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</aside>

<style>
  .photo-ready {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .photo-ready > span {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .photo-ready img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    border-radius: inherit;
  }

  .profile-card-expanded {
    padding: 17px;
  }

  .profile-summary {
    color: #a9b9c4 !important;
    line-height: 1.75 !important;
  }

  .can-do {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(190, 220, 240, .16);
  }

  .can-do ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 7px;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .can-do li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 12px;
    color: #a9b9c4;
    font-size: 9px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .can-do li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: .62em;
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #68d4f8;
  }

  .focus-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .focus-list div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8px 1fr;
    gap: 9px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .focus-dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #68d4f8;
    box-shadow: 0 0 9px rgba(104, 212, 248, .45);
  }

  .focus-list strong {
    color: #c7d2d9;
    font-size: 9px;
  }

  .cap-group {
    margin-top: 15px;
  }

  .cap-group small {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: #6f8390;
    font: 800 7px/1 ui-monospace, monospace;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  .cap-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 5px;
  }

  .cap-tags span {
    padding: 5px 7px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(190, 220, 240, .16);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: rgba(18, 30, 42, .78);
    color: #aebec8;
    font-size: 8px;
  }
</style>
